  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIf you have a World in the Group Activity Category in the Main Menu Social Tab behind the Main Menu Tab bar, it can block you from clicking on the Tab bar.\n\nTo get this to happen you need to hover above the World and then move your courser down over the Main Menu Tab bar. If you do this you will notice that World will stay selected and prevents you from interacting with the Tab bar, clicking will now open the World details page instead of switching the tabs.\n\nThis is not an issue with the Group Activity in the Group Tab it self, it only happens the Social Tab.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe Tab bar should always be on top of everything else in the Menu, in this case it is visually, but not *technically*. It should just behave the same way as the Group Activity does in the Groups Tab\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/lwq9ne.mp4",
